X-WR-TIMEZONE:Asia/Kolkata
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:v6-repeat-1@secondthought
DTSTAMP:20261104T025000Z
DTSTART:20261201T043000Z
DTEND:20261201T060000Z
SUMMARY:V6 repeat — public URL durability check (30 min)
DESCRIPTION:1. Open the URL COLD in a fresh browser profile. Time it — 
 under 1s means it did not sleep.\n2. python3 scripts/v6_cold_check.py --
 url https://<app>.onrender.com --record (then --compare afterwards).\n3.
  All three personas render: Ada OFFER, Ben DEFER, Cleo DECLINE.\n4. /hea
 lthz reads SANDBOX + LLM. If either says SIMULATED or LLM-MOCK, a key ha
 s fallen off the service.\n5. Save a profile in one browser; check a sec
 ond browser still sees the untouched personas.\n6. Create one invoice fr
 om the URL, find the INV2- in the PayPal sandbox dashboard.\n7. POST a w
 ebhook with a bad signature; confirm 400 and that it appears at /diagnos
 tics.\n8. Note the boot id. It must be the same one recorded last time, 
 or explain why it restarted.\n9. Log the result in docs/plan/V6_deployme
 nt.md §results with the date and the boot id.
LOCATION:https://second-thought.onrender.com
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT60M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:V6 durability check — the contest requires the demo to stay
  up
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
